cracklib
------------------------------------------
CrackLib tests passwords to determine whether they match certain
security-oriented characteristics, such as being found in a dictionary. It
provides a library for checking passwords and utilities for building and
querying the dictionary.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcrack-devel-2.10.4-1bl1
  libcrack2-2.10.4-1bl1
  libintl8-0.26-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1
  python312-3.12.12-1
  python312-cracklib-2.10.4-1bl1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.26-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/cracklib/cracklib/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/cracklib/cracklib/releases/download/v2.10.4/cracklib-2.10.4.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cracklib-2.10.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cracklib-2.10.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cracklib-2.10.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cracklib-2.10.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcrack2-2.10.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcrack-devel-2.10.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-cracklib-2.10.4-X.tar.xz

